{"seq":20,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-05-vantorre-tickets/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:06:38.287Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-16T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"f3bd135c9c587379b22e73940186043596ae84213a10b3fcfe80cd207fb1ea03","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Nadia, I found five ticket references on Vantorre Group (the parent) across the three sources. I left out Mobility's tickets.\n\n| Ticket | What it is | Source |\n|---|---|---|\n| **#PD-4418** | The `Carrier_Dwell_Summary` export drops timestamps for Dock Door 9 at the 04:00 shift changeover. A warehouse supervisor raised it. | Moss digest 9/15/2025 |\n| **#PD-8841** / **#8841** | Gate and kiosk problems, described differently in each source (see below). | #strategic-pod (7/1/2026); Moss digests 4/27, 5/4 and 9/30/2026 |\n| **INC-4821** | Hartford gate kiosks went offline on 8/3. Gideon attached a screenshot for the status-page access issue. | #inc-vtg-hartford (8/3/2026) |\n| **VT-55120** | Root-cause ticket for the Hartford kiosk outage. It holds Carrowmere's gateway route finding and the reconnect log. | #inc-vtg-hartford (Gideon, 10/14/2026) |\n\nThings to check before this goes to Mateo:\n- **#8841 is described inconsistently.**\n  - **#strategic-pod, 7/1:** Gideon says he closed it, for a kiosk tablet browser-cache issue.\n  - **Digest 4/27:** it is #PD-8841, for missed carrier check-ins at Allentown Gate 4.\n  - **Digest 5/4:** it is open, for a gate kiosk timeout at Allentown Door 12.\n  - **Digest 9/30:** it is open, for drivers at Newark who can't select Door 14.\n\n  This could be one ticket that was reopened, or the number may have been reused or mislabeled. Support should confirm.\n- **Two ticket numbers are not tied to a customer here.**\n  - **Digests 3/10/2025 and 12/1/2025:** both mention Vantorre issues (gate check-in delays, duplicate arrivals at door 6) without a ticket number.\n  - **Digest 5/3/2026:** it mentions duplicate arrival entries at door 14 \"on the existing support thread\" without a number.\n\n  I haven't counted any of these as tickets.\n- **Left out as not Vantorre Group:** #4812 (Mobility, digest 3/10/2025) and #PD-4402 (Quillfeather, digest 9/15/2025).\n- **My view is limited to what's in those three sources.** Support's own ticket system may hold more tickets, and I can't see it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1792159200.000126"}}
